# Catalog stubs (`dv-*/`) are written here at runtime by the SessionStart
# hook, and are re-fetched on every session start — so a marketplace
# `git pull` that wipes them is self-healing. We still ignore the prefix
# so stubs do not show up as local modifications, do not appear in diffs
# of plugin PRs, and survive the brief window between `git pull` finishing
# and the hook writing them back.
dv-*/
